ript tags**: Removes all `<script>...</script>` tags and their content\n2. **Event handlers**: Removes attributes like `onclick`, `onerror`, `onload`, `onmouseover`, etc.\n3. **JavaScript URLs**: Removes `javascript:` protocol from href/src attributes\n\nThe script reads the HTML file, removes all JavaScript vectors, and writes it back in-place with formatting preserved.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\npython filter.py input.html\n```\n\nThis will modify `input.html` to remove all JavaScript while keeping the HTML structure, formatting, tables, headers, and legitimate attributes intact.","ttft_ms":23930,"type":"result","duration_ms":26289,"uuid":"b7926ed7-3309-469d-aae8-4234e8a61852","ttft_stream_ms":802,"time_to_request_ms":84,"queued_turn_count":0}
